 5	 *
 6	 * Covers:
 7	 *  1. Clickable link for projects that have a repository_name (AC-7)
 8	 *  2. Read-only name cell for projects with null repository_name (AC-7)
 9	 *  3. ProjectNameCache is populated with the composite key (AC-7)
